    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently ask about the layer ideal for flying jet aircrafts (Stratosphere due to constant temperatures and lack of weather disturbances).",
        "The Ionosphere is located within the Thermosphere and facilitates radio transmission by reflecting radio waves back to Earth.",
        "The boundary where atmospheric temperature stops decreasing in the lowest layer is known as the Tropopause.",
        "Coldest atmospheric temperatures occur at the Mesopause, the upper boundary of the Mesosphere."
      ],
